{"title":"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rectangle has dimensions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/1/1213ebfba52a1ecd1bc228ec17b690e84c1c4d0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$67 \\times 75$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />.\nThe diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is divided into five\nsegments of equal length. Find the\ntotal area of the shaded regions.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d2f4704d94eb6ca2088440d227f21bcc331bbf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A,B,C,D; A==(0,0);B=(75,0);C=(75,67);D=(0,67); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle,black); filldraw(A--(D+.2(B-D))--C--(D+.4(B-D))--cycle,blue); filldraw(A--(D+.6(B-D))--C--(D+.8(B-D))--cycle,blue); draw(B--D,black); dot(D+.2(B-D));dot(D+.4(B-D));dot(D+.6(B-D));dot(D+.8(B-D)); MP(&quot;A&quot;,D,NW);MP(&quot;B&quot;,B,SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"225\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice the rectangle is divided into 10 triangles of equal triangles. Therefore, the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b771e27fe6f7920926183dfee864b051c3dfbf82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the area of the rectangle, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21f419ecd9e9d337ec3a8183a93cbaf7a2e22f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac 25\\cdot 75 \\cdot 67 = \\boxed {2010}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"151\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II\">2010 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"te